  'navigation.deferredBill':['Week {week}: instalment {payment} Cr deferred to the final payment; current operating costs {operating} Cr still due, before unforeseen changes.','Semaine {week} : mensualité de {payment} Cr reportée au paiement final ; charges actuelles de {operating} Cr dues, hors imprévus.'],
